Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.09,0:05:12.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.50,0:00:44.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-放手  让我过去  -你不能过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me go. Let me go. - You can't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.02,0:00:47.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,菲利普\N{\fnArial\fs30}Philip.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.03,0:00:50.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-别多管闲事  -他是我朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay out of this. - He's my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.07,0:00:52.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可做不了主\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not up to me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.72,0:00:54.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-大伙儿说了算  -什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The people have spoken. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.57,0:00:58.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我曾问你忠诚何在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked you where your loyalties lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.46,0:00:59.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.94,0:01:01.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那好  证明啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.16,0:01:03.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,证明给大伙儿看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prove it to us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.95,0:01:08.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-兄弟俩来场决斗  -没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Brother against brother. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.33,0:01:09.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胜者将获得自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winner goes free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.28,0:01:15.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拼死一战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.10,0:01:22.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,菲利普  求你了  别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Philip, please. Don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.98,0:01:24.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.67,0:01:30.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-加油  莫尔  -上呀  莫尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go, Merle! - Come on, Merle!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.18,0:01:33.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好样的  莫尔  -好样儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, Merle! - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.24,0:01:35.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的为人  大伙儿都清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.72,0:01:38.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必将竭尽全力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna do,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.94,0:01:41.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拼死作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever I got to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.81,0:01:43.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以证明...\N{\fnArial\fs30}to prove...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.86,0:01:52.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对小镇的耿耿忠心\N{\fnArial\fs30}that my loyalty is to this town!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.39,0:02:22.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.24,0:02:23.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这帮人会放过你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}asshole's gonna let you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.11,0:02:26.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老弟  看我眼色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just follow my lead, little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.56,0:02:29.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱俩现在就逃出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're getting out of this right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.86,0:02:49.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,菲利普  让他们住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Philip, stop this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.55,0:02:51.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,菲利普  快让他们住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Philip, stop this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.92,0:03:34.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老弟  快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.28,0:03:40.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay close!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.26,0:03:41.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.60,0:03:53.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莫尔  快跟上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.20,0:03:55.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.29,0:04:14.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.69,0:04:19.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们撤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.59,0:04:26.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.90,0:04:28.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-咱们撤  -撤\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go.  - Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.30,0:05:25.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都在竞技场  走这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all at the arena. This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.25,0:05:26.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别跟着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going anywhere with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.97,0:05:28.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紧要关头  一会儿再说好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really want to do this right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.15,0:05:31.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快打开啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.63,0:05:32.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.31,0:05:37.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克  快点  我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, come on. We've got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.35,0:05:39.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.26,0:05:45.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还愣着干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little help would be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.48,0:05:55.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走  没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ain't got time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.42,0:05:57.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.15,0:06:26.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.67,0:06:28.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick. Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.69,0:06:30.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.27,0:06:32.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.78,0:06:35.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们带了位不速之客  你们先退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we got a problem here. I need you to back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.69,0:06:37.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈的  他来干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.94,0:06:40.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-放下刀  -他想要杀死我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Put it down! - He tried to kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.67,0:06:41.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放下刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.64,0:06:43.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-要不是他...  -我们能逃出来  多亏有他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If it wasn't for him-- - He helped us get out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.90,0:06:45.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  但他也把你打了个半死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right after he beat the shit out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.80,0:06:48.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-嘿  我也受伤了啊  -蠢蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, we both took our licks, man. - Jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.54,0:06:50.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-闭嘴  -都别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, shut up. - Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.94,0:06:53.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-放松  -把刀放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Relax. - Put it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.38,0:06:55.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别用枪指着老子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get that thing out of my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.87,0:06:58.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小弟  你身边真是帮乌合之众\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, look like you've gone native, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.40,0:07:00.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么比得了你  居然和那疯子为伍\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more than you hanging out with that psycho back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.62,0:07:04.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  但他挺有魅力的  这点我得承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, man. He is a charmer, I got to tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.32,0:07:06.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把你闺蜜安德利亚干得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been putting the wood in your girlfriend Andrea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.51,0:07:09.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不亦乐乎啊  宝贝儿  -什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Big time, baby. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.78,0:07:11.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安德利亚在伍德伯里镇吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea's in Woodbury?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.56,0:07:13.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总督的左右手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right next to the Governor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.76,0:07:15.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫你放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you to drop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.04,0:07:18.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认识安德莉亚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know Andrea?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.91,0:07:22.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认识安德莉亚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, do you know Andrea?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.93,0:07:24.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep, she does.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.25,0:07:27.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她和金发美女在森林里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her and blondie spent all winter
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.13,0:07:29.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,躲了一个冬天\N{\fnArial\fs30}cuddling up in the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.33,0:07:35.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位猛女还养了两只行尸宝宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}My new-being queen here had two pet walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.73,0:07:38.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没胳膊  没下巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}No arms, cut off the jaws,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.27,0:07:39.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用链条锁着\N{\fnArial\fs30}kept them in chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.25,0:07:43.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那光景真有趣  -闭嘴  哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kind of ironic now that I think about it. - Shut up, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.97,0:07:45.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我们把她俩从森林里救出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, we snagged them out of the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.82,0:07:47.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安德莉亚当时奄奄一息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea is close to dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.35,0:07:50.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-所以她才跟他在一块儿吗  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that why she's with him? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.89,0:07:52.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像虫子一样黏在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snug as two little bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.82,0:07:54.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在打算怎么办  警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what you gonna do now, Sheriff, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.40,0:07:58.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-被一群骗子  暴徒和懦夫包围着  -闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Surrounded by a bunch of liars, thugs, and cowards. - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.30,0:08:02.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  快瞧瞧  真可悲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man, look at this. Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.35,0:08:05.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-都揣着没子弹的枪  -莫尔  闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All these guns and no bullets in them. - Merle, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.33,0:08:08.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要闭你自己闭  一群孬种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up yourself! Bunch of pussies you roll--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.12,0:08:16.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.26,0:08:29.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以一周后自己拆线\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can take those stiches out yourself in a week or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.77,0:08:30.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.42,0:08:33.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,懂医学知识真是好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty nice having medical training.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.49,0:08:36.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没啥大用处\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll only get you so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.66,0:08:39.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你被咬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.91,0:08:53.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小宝宝多大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How old is the baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.87,0:08:55.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有一周大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barely a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.13,0:09:03.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老实说  我们没想到还能看到婴儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be honest, we never thought we'd see another baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.06,0:09:08.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.92,0:09:09.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.70,0:09:12.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你感觉如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.86,0:09:17.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.91,0:09:19.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那妈妈在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.10,0:09:25.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.33,0:09:29.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  你们受的苦真不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, you people have been through the mill.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.15,0:09:33.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁不是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't we all?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.85,0:09:37.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面只会更糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only getting worse out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.16,0:09:39.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到处都是行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.02,0:09:42.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只会让活人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's only making the living
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.75,0:09:45.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不像活人\N{\fnArial\fs30}less like the living.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.64,0:09:48.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是我们碰到的唯一好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the only decent folks we've come across.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.42,0:09:51.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们一直在外面吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been out there all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.78,0:09:52.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认识一个叫杰瑞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I met a Jerry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.09,0:09:55.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他总是杞人忧天\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's one of those survivalist nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.49,0:09:57.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邻居都以为他疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody on the block thought he was crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.27,0:09:58.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总是在为世界末日准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always preparing for the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.96,0:10:01.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-世事难料啊  -杰瑞料到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who knew? - Jerry knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.27,0:10:04.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在后院的棚屋下建了个地堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had a bunker under his shed in the backyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.52,0:10:07.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨沙和我躲在里面  直到补给用完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sasha and I stay there until we run out of supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.17,0:10:11.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾伦和本是我们从\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allen and Ben were the first two people we ran into
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.04,0:10:13.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰克逊维尔那个地堡爬出来后\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we finally crawled up out of that hole
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.59,0:10:15.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最先碰到的两个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}around Jacksonville.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.59,0:10:17.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们原先人很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Used to be a bunch of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.74,0:10:19.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曾达到25个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}25 at one point.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.86,0:10:24.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的营地六七周前失陷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our camp was overrun six, seven weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.76,0:10:27.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而堂娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}And-- and Donna,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.10,0:10:30.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她\N{\fnArial\fs30}she, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.34,0:10:37.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会给她个体面的葬礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see that she has a proper burial.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.56,0:10:40.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常感谢你照顾我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate you taking care of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.05,0:10:44.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很久以来  我们都不敢相信生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a while, we didn't know who we were dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.30,0:10:45.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither did we.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.64,0:10:48.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都分不清什么是人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've had a problem with what's people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.98,0:10:50.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定是史上第一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must be the first brother in history
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.69,0:10:52.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,往监狱里跑的黑人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to break into prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.88,0:10:55.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我就是第一个不想越狱白人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes me the first white boy that didn't want to break out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.83,0:11:06.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泰尔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tyreese.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.53,0:11:10.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如我所言  我们的队伍还有其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said, we have a much larger group.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.93,0:11:13.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,团结而紧密\N{\fnArial\fs30}A close-knit group.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.86,0:11:17.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我建议你别过得太舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't get too comfortable here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.17,0:11:21.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会惹事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wouldn't be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.55,0:11:25.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不取决于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.00,0:11:27.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那取决于谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then who?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.07,0:11:32.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  你也看到我们是什么样的人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, you can see what kind of people we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.45,0:11:45.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.22,0:11:48.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-必须这样  -会制造事端的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's gotta. - It'll stir things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.92,0:11:49.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  总督现在可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, the Governor is
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.45,0:11:51.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正在赶往监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}probably on the way to the prison right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.63,0:11:53.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莫尔了解他  而且我们需要帮手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle knows how he thinks and we could use the muscle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.56,0:11:54.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不能跟我们回监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not having him at the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.99,0:11:56.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你难道想让他跟我们住在同一区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really want him to sleep with us
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.72,0:11:57.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟卡萝尔和贝丝一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the same block with Carol and Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.69,0:11:59.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他不是强奸犯  -他的同伙是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He ain't a rapist. - Well, his buddy is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.63,0:12:01.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚之后他们已经不是同伙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They ain't buddies no more. Not after last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.66,0:12:02.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莫尔跟我们住\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way Merle's gonna live there
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.89,0:12:05.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都不会好过\N{\fnArial\fs30}without putting everyone at each other's throats.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.03,0:12:06.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想让莫尔留在野外\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're gonna cut Merle loose
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.00,0:12:07.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带那个武士回去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and bring the last samurai home with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.12,0:12:08.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她也不能回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.23,0:12:10.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她现在的状况没法独自生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not in a state to be on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.88,0:12:12.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是她带你们来救我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She did bring you guys to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.38,0:12:13.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但她半路失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And ditched us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.88,0:12:16.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-至少让我父亲给她缝针  -她不稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}-At least let my dad stitch her up. - She's too unpredictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.61,0:12:18.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说的对  我们还不知道她是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. We don't know who she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.68,0:12:21.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但莫尔是兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Merle, Merle's blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.30,0:12:23.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  莫尔是你的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Merle is your blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.63,0:12:26.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的兄弟姐妹  我的家人此刻正站在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}My blood,my family is standing right here,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.16,0:12:27.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有那些在监狱等着我们回去的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and waiting for us back at the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.60,0:12:29.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你也是这个家族的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're part of that family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.67,0:12:34.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他不是  他不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's not. He's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.31,0:12:37.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们别乱说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, y'all don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.26,0:12:44.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们自己照顾自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. We'll fend for ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.93,0:12:46.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说的不是这个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what I was saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.80,0:12:48.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有他就没有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No him, no me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.27,0:12:50.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔你不必那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl, you don't have to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.62,0:12:53.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正我和莫尔相依为命惯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's always Merle and I before this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.87,0:12:55.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不要这样  -你真想这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't. - You serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.84,0:12:57.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就想这样一走了之\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just gonna leave like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.21,0:12:58.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们也是这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd do the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.24,0:12:59.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要向卡萝尔怎么交代\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want us to tell Carol?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.98,0:13:02.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她会理解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.35,0:13:10.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,替我向你父亲告别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say good-bye to your pop for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.75,0:13:13.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔  你真要走吗  达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl, are you serious? Daryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.24,0:13:17.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定有其他办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's got to be another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.50,0:13:23.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝不会丢下他不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ask me to leave him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.15,0:13:24.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经错过一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already did that once.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.36,0:13:32.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们昨晚挑起了事端\N{\fnArial\fs30}We started something last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.37,0:13:34.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没意识到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You realize that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.04,0:13:37.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没他就没我  就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No him, no me. That's all I can say.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.61,0:13:44.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们保重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.65,0:13:47.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照顾好小拽女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of lil ass-kicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.33,0:13:49.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.55,0:13:53.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是个坚强的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's one tough kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.88,0:14:01.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.84,0:14:04.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧  哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.92,0:14:23.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们给你缝好针后赶紧离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We patch you up and then you are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.60,0:14:45.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们说在哪里埋她来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd they say we could bury her?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.52,0:14:47.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,场地后面  挨着其他坟墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back of the field near the other graves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.77,0:14:52.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等下  等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Wait a minute. Wait a minute. Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.50,0:14:53.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,调整一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Losing my grip here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.86,0:14:54.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.60,0:15:20.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝好时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Golden opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.22,0:15:22.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.61,0:15:23.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有一个小孩和女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little kid and a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.03,0:15:29.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假意让他们帮忙  趁机夺取武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask them for a hand, get a hold of those weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.41,0:15:31.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么  -动作快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - We do it quick,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.25,0:15:32.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出其不意\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'll never know what hit them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.94,0:15:36.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不  等等  -我们是来埋葬唐娜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. Whoa, whoa. - We're out here to bury Donna.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.30,0:15:38.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夺完枪之后再埋\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will, after.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.71,0:15:40.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-别这样  -看看这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut up. - Look at this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.73,0:15:41.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.23,0:15:44.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他们是好人  -很简单的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- These are good people. - This will be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.05,0:15:46.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个小孩  一个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little kid, a woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.98,0:15:48.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个女孩和独腿老人\N{\fnArial\fs30}a girl and a one-legged old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.88,0:15:50.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了还有个囚犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget about the convict.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.88,0:15:52.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你难道准备谋杀一个婴儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna smash the baby's head with a rock?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.56,0:15:55.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你有什么毛病  -你能不能正派点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is your problem? - How about a little common decency?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.70,0:15:57.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人不能做出这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't what we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.25,0:16:00.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还生活在过去  泰\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're living in the past, Ty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.32,0:16:04.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也是  这是适者生存的时代  很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}So are you. This is survival of the fittest, plain and simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.37,0:16:06.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这就能活  出去就会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here we live,out there we die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.48,0:16:09.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会坐等他们团队的其他人回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am not waiting around for the rest of their group
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.44,0:16:11.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把我们赶出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}to roll in here and throw us out on our asses.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.53,0:16:14.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-没门  -你怎么肯定他们会赶我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not a chance. - How do you know that's gonna happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.18,0:16:16.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你们拿了些工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got some tools for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.03,0:16:25.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's much appreciated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.51,0:16:26.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我们就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we'll take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.93,0:16:31.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不需要帮忙埋尸体吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need no help with the body?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.17,0:16:33.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用了  我们能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we will manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.23,0:16:36.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果要帮忙请尽管开口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us know if you need anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.70,0:16:37.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.00,0:17:15.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看一下刹车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep in the brakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.82,0:17:22.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.51,0:17:51.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.90,0:17:58.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们回去不是为了杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not why we went back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.90,0:18:02.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  你回去是为了救出达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. That's right. You went back for Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.31,0:18:05.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可现在达里尔走了  总督依然活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now he's gone again and the Governor is still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.44,0:18:06.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救出达里尔是头等大事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl was the priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.92,0:18:08.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我应该跟你们一起去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have been there with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.26,0:18:09.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可你受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are in no condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.91,0:18:11.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道我女友没受伤吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my girl friend was?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.21,0:18:12.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格伦  这不是你我之间的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn, this isn't about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.91,0:18:14.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我应该去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.61,0:18:16.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有和我们一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, you didn't come back with us
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.44,0:18:17.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因为你伤得连站都站不稳\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you could barely walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.60,0:18:18.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那她呢  -我怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about her? - What about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.94,0:18:20.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道他对她做了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what he did to her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.62,0:18:21.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别提这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave it alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.18,0:18:23.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你知道吗  -我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you know? - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.68,0:18:37.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们费了这么大功夫  冒了这么大的险\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all that effort, all the risk we took,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.10,0:18:40.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔就这样离开我们跟着莫尔走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl just takes off with Merle?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.62,0:18:42.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他有他的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he had his reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.92,0:18:45.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续自欺欺人吧  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you keep telling yourself that, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.64,0:18:49.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,改变不了我们惹上大麻烦的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't change the fact that we're up to our necks in shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.09,0:18:51.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你希望我回去找他  求他回来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to turn the car around, beg him to come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.91,0:18:54.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,热烈欢迎莫尔回归吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw down a welcome mat for Merle?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.08,0:18:56.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经跟他打过交道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the hand we've been dealt!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.49,0:18:59.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把车弄走赶紧回去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just get this out of here and get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.46,0:19:01.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回去休息一下  有话回去再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some rest. We can talk out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.53,0:19:06.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要谈你们谈  我已经谈够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you guys do all the talking you want. I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.90,0:19:19.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多少人受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many injured?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.31,0:19:20.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,九个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.11,0:19:22.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯蒂文斯在照看他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stevens has it covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.64,0:19:25.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.41,0:19:28.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-在房间里  -然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In his apartment. - And?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.69,0:19:29.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不肯开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wouldn't open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.74,0:19:31.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说他很忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said he was in the middle of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.39,0:19:33.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大叫大嚷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk on the hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.22,0:19:47.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.04,0:19:48.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冷静一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.00,0:19:52.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-退开  -这里不安全  我们要离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Back away. - It's not safe here. We want to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.27,0:19:54.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-外面可都是行尸  -让我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's biters out here, lady. - Let us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.65,0:19:56.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.65,0:20:00.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说过让你退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.71,0:20:02.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有人可以离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.87,0:20:04.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马丁内斯  有行尸过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Martinez, we got biters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.04,0:20:05.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干掉它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, take them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.17,0:20:13.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都冷静下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.23,0:20:14.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能再待在这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't stay here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.29,0:20:15.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.21,0:20:16.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  让我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.09,0:20:18.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯伦  外面太危险  你不能出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Karen, you don't want to go out there. It's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.37,0:20:20.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们宁愿冒一下险  -拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, well, we'll take our chances. - Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.96,0:20:27.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别鸣喇叭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, knock off the horn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.23,0:20:29.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-别鸣喇叭  -马丁那\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Knock off that horn. - Matina.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.39,0:20:32.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-下车  -放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get out of the car. - Put the gun down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.05,0:20:34.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-出来  -别\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get out of the car. - Hey. Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.71,0:20:36.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不许动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't hurt him. Don't hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.79,0:20:37.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不听你指挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I don't take orders from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.98,0:20:41.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人吓坏了  用枪指着他们只会让他们更慌\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people are scared. Shoving a gun in their face won't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.15,0:20:42.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总督在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the Governor?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.71,0:20:44.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里发生暴乱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a riot out here. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.19,0:20:45.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这是添乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're making things worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.29,0:20:47.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.81,0:20:51.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-怎么回事  -走\N{\fnArial\fs30}-What the hell? - Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.80,0:21:01.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,退开  退开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back, get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.84,0:21:25.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.56,0:21:27.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.67,0:21:30.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  救救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.93,0:21:35.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.84,0:21:41.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.00,0:22:15.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.93,0:22:23.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都快忘了这个世界以前有多么吵\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's easy to forget how loud the world used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.94,0:22:27.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以前经常抱怨这个世界太吵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to complain about it all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.70,0:22:30.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,车流  工地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traffic, construction,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.74,0:22:34.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,汽车报警器  噪音污染\N{\fnArial\fs30}car alarms, noise pollution.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.21,0:22:42.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在要是能听到喷气式客机的声音该多好\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I wouldn't give for the sweet sound of a jumbo jet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.73,0:22:48.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是我们都能上飞机就更好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'd be even sweeter if we were all on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.27,0:22:58.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你妈妈很为你骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mom was proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.40,0:23:04.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骄傲什么  对她恶声恶气的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what? Being mean to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.42,0:23:08.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you can't think about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.37,0:23:11.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我脑子里想的全是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all I think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.88,0:23:16.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但愿是他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please be them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.24,0:23:22.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是他们  快\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's them. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.12,0:23:35.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-开上去  我们上面见  -好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Drive 'em up. I'll meet you there. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.89,0:23:37.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.16,0:23:44.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-赫谢尔在哪儿  -他在牢房里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Hershel? - He's in the cell block.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.29,0:23:45.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Daryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.21,0:23:49.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事  他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. He's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.22,0:23:52.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们碰到了他哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ran into his brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.14,0:23:56.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They went off.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.09,0:24:01.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He left?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.12,0:24:08.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl left?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.26,0:24:11.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.38,0:24:15.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还回来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he coming back?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.11,0:24:26.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.55,0:24:29.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奥斯卡呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Oscar?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.25,0:24:33.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.47,0:25:06.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这到底是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.06,0:25:09.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在众目睽睽之下朝那人脑袋开了一枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You put a round in a man's head in front of all those people
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.63,0:25:11.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后就这么离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and just take off?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.96,0:25:14.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你得和大伙谈谈  -为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have to talk to them. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.46,0:25:17.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们惊慌失措  准备夺门而逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're panicking. They were ready to charge through those gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.42,0:25:19.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他们去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.97,0:25:22.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些人活不到明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those people won't last a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.66,0:25:24.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们以前过得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those people have had it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.93,0:25:27.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又是烧烤又是野餐  都到此为止了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barbecues and picnics. That ends now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.29,0:25:29.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你惹下的乱子  别怪他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't blame them for the mess that you created.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.99,0:25:31.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.20,0:25:33.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不再保护他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm through holding their hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.59,0:25:34.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们正处于战争中\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're at war.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.13,0:25:36.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该看得出\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have seen that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.97,0:25:40.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那为什么达里尔在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why was Daryl here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.32,0:25:43.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他参与恐怖袭击了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was he part of the assault?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.35,0:25:46.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  他为什么会那样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Why would he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.27,0:25:47.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他为他的朋友们而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He came for his friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.34,0:25:49.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些人你也认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other people you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.59,0:25:52.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格伦和玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn and Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.82,0:25:54.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莫尔发现他们在逃亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle scooped them up on the run.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.84,0:25:57.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就把他们带回来问他弟弟的下落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was holding them to find out where his brother was.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.43,0:26:03.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的朋友们还活着 而且我们还互相开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}My-- my friends are still alive and we're shooting at each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.96,0:26:05.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想处决他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're trying to execute them?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.34,0:26:07.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的朋友们杀了六个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friends killed six good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.07,0:26:09.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克罗利  提姆  加尔朱洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley, Tim, Gargulio,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.78,0:26:11.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾森伯格  鲍勃·亚当斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eisenberg, Bob Adams.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.76,0:26:13.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,海莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haley.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.57,0:26:18.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面的那人  理查德·法斯特  是第七个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That man out there, Richard Faster, he makes seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.03,0:26:20.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你朋友们的所作所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's what your friends did.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.64,0:26:23.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不告诉我他们在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you tell me they were here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.46,0:26:26.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你瞒着我  而我们却在...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kept that from me while we were...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.53,0:26:32.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在这里只是个访客\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just a visitor here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.55,0:26:35.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,路过而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just passing through.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.98,0:26:37.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么要告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why should I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.47,0:26:43.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.83,0:26:47.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要赶走我  现在不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't drive me out. Not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.78,0:26:49.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.10,0:26:52.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整个镇上的人都出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole town is out on the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.20,0:26:53.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情况可能再次变糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could get ugly again.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.85,0:27:09.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带你姐姐进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your sister inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.73,0:27:24.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.60,0:27:33.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你平安归来了 和以往一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came through, like always.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.64,0:27:37.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们手头上好像又有新问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like we have a new problem on our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.39,0:27:39.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是啊  -你看清楚他的样子了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - You get a good look at him?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.69,0:27:45.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他让达里尔和莫尔自相残杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had Daryl and Merle pitted against each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.48,0:27:50.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一群人欢呼着  让他们生死决斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A crowd cheering for them to fight to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.08,0:27:53.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么样的变态会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of a sick mind does that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.95,0:27:56.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,林子大了什么鸟都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}A kind this world creates.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.91,0:28:02.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  婴儿不好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong? The baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.43,0:28:04.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  婴儿很健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the baby, she's healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.25,0:28:07.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃得香  睡得甜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eats like a horse, sleeps like a rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.25,0:28:10.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.08,0:28:46.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不怎么健谈  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly a chatterbox, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.01,0:28:48.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耐心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.92,0:28:52.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等时机成熟  让我来谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it's ready, let me do the talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.71,0:29:03.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她的眼睛有点像洛莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}She kind of has Lori's eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.82,0:29:04.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不觉得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.10,0:29:46.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各位  请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone, if I could--
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.88,0:29:48.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I could have your attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.72,0:29:51.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-各位  -好了  大家不要说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everyone. - All right, everybody shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.62,0:29:53.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.24,0:29:57.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,防线周围的行尸都被消灭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The biters on the perimeter have been dispatched.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.05,0:29:59.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-围墙也修好了  -暂时而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The fences have been repaired. - For now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.44,0:30:00.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总督在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the Governor?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.05,0:30:04.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}His-- his condition is...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.57,0:30:06.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不太稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}unsteady.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.47,0:30:07.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wound he suffered--
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.80,0:30:10.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们的朋友被杀了  -他对理查德开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Our friends were killed, man. - He shot Richard.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.86,0:30:13.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都遭罪了  我们想要说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we've all suffered. We want answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.20,0:30:19.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对  卡伦  你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right, Karen. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.16,0:30:22.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都经历了痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every one of us has suffered.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.50,0:30:26.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死的人太多了我们都来不及\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't even have funerals anymore because
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.68,0:30:28.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,举行葬礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}the death never stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.29,0:30:33.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会是从前的我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll never gonna be the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.31,0:30:35.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远不会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.08,0:30:38.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们要怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.19,0:30:44.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要努力  找到继续前行的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}We dig deep and we find the strength to carry on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.58,0:30:48.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,团结一致  重建家园\N{\fnArial\fs30}We work together, and we rebuild.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.63,0:30:51.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不仅仅重建围墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just the fences,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.18,0:30:53.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大门和社区\N{\fnArial\fs30}the gates, the community,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.32,0:30:55.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也要重建我们自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}but ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.56,0:30:58.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的心  我们的思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our hearts, our minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.56,0:31:01.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很多年以后  当人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And years from now, when they write about this plague
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.01,0:31:02.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,编写这次瘟疫的历史时\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the history books,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.71,0:31:04.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会写到世外桃源小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}they will write about Woodbury.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.81,0:31:08.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们坚持过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We persevered.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.61,0:31:17.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是的  他们会的  -世外桃源小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, they will. - Woodbury.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.88,0:31:35.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你掌握了技巧呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got a knack for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.67,0:31:39.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是做好份内事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trying to do my part.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.08,0:31:42.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,索菲亚曾经像闹钟一样凌晨三点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sophia used to wake the neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.22,0:31:45.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准时吵醒邻居\N{\fnArial\fs30}3 a.m.like clockwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.79,0:31:52.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在她安静下来前  爱德都得睡在朋友家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed stayed at a friend's most nights till she calmed down.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.32,0:31:57.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直想要个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Al always wanted a child
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.75,0:32:05.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果没有达里尔她活不下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wouldn't have made it if Daryl hadn't been here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.93,0:32:07.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他无法承受再失去别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He couldn't stand to lose anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.97,0:32:10.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听起来像他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.24,0:32:14.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白他为什么非要走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see why he had to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.83,0:32:16.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莫尔听起来像个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle sounds like a jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.30,0:32:20.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莫尔那样的人能给你洗脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men like Merle get into your head,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.78,0:32:25.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你觉得被虐待罪有应得\N{\fnArial\fs30}makes you feel like you deserve the abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.96,0:32:28.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对达里尔也是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even for Daryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.36,0:32:34.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和一年前判若两人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hardly the woman I was a year ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.01,0:32:36.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果爱德现在活着从那扇门走进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if Ed walked through that door right now
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.11,0:32:37.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我跟他走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathing and told me to go with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.87,0:32:40.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望我会告诉他去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to think I'd tell him to go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.35,0:32:44.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.37,0:32:48.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不重要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.33,0:32:53.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有他我们很弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're weak without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.15,0:32:56.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也会挺过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get through this, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.73,0:33:01.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泰尔西和他的朋友看起来很厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tyreese and his friends seem capable.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.43,0:33:04.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他走了我很生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pissed at him for leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.97,0:33:06.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.95,0:33:09.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔有他自己的原则\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl has his code.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.25,0:33:13.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个世界需要那样的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This world needs men like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.13,0:33:22.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.06,0:33:28.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好了  -装她正好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There. - She fits perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.39,0:33:29.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.79,0:33:32.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,躺得舒服吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. You cozy in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.98,0:33:34.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(小拽女)
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.81,0:33:42.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被揍得这么狠\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got worked over good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.04,0:33:46.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骨头没断很令我惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprised no bones were broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.14,0:33:49.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔哥哥干的好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coutsey of Daryl's brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.48,0:34:08.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你俩还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.21,0:34:17.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你保护她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for looking out for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.81,0:34:20.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.00,0:34:26.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去看看她  你还要点什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go check on her. You need something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.92,0:34:29.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.90,0:34:40.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也是一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same thing goes for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.16,0:34:44.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你有什么不测的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anything worse than this happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.19,0:34:49.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你像我的亲儿子一样  格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're like my own son, Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.73,0:35:07.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,需要我给你看看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got something needs looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.41,0:35:10.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格伦没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Glenn alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.44,0:35:15.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己去看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go see.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.61,0:35:37.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个好像有事瞒着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two seem to be holding something back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.17,0:35:42.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想告诉我发生什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to tell me what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.83,0:35:53.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能自立我很欣慰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I rest easy knowing you can handle youself.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.24,0:35:57.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你继承了你母亲的精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got your mother's spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.33,0:36:01.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有她的固执\N{\fnArial\fs30}And her stubbornness.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.61,0:36:08.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饿了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.83,0:36:11.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.83,0:36:24.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再离开我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't disappear on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.30,0:36:52.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她昏睡不醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's out like a light.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.74,0:36:56.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定几天没睡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be days since she slept.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.66,0:37:01.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看上去也很疲惫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look pretty shot yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.31,0:37:03.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要多久她才能上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long before she can travel?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.47,0:37:04.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照顾好她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep an eye on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.95,0:37:07.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以肯定她得了脑震荡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty sure she has a concussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.35,0:37:10.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是醒了也得几天时间恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple of days if she's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.02,0:37:23.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,托马斯发飙时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whenever Tomas went off,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.79,0:37:26.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奥斯卡总帮着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oscar always stood up for me, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.85,0:37:30.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是我朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.99,0:37:32.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是去战斗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He went out fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.85,0:37:37.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.99,0:37:39.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为总督会报复吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think the Governor will retaliate?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.99,0:37:42.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是的  -让他尽管放马来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Let him try.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.23,0:37:43.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说他领导一个镇的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like he's got a whole town.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.52,0:37:45.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们人少枪少\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're outnumbered and outgunned.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.28,0:37:48.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们可以找人支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}could use some reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.09,0:38:17.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫泰尔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Tyreese.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.50,0:38:25.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨沙  艾伦  本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sasha, Allen, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.43,0:38:29.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们怎么进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you get in?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.83,0:38:32.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,监狱管理区着过火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire damage to the administrative part of the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.58,0:38:33.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,墙塌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wall's down.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.18,0:38:36.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那边全都是行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}That side's completely overrun with walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.26,0:38:37.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们怎么活到现在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you get this far?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.15,0:38:41.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不全活着  我们失去了堂娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't. We lost our friend Donna.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.78,0:38:43.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在健身馆迷了路\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were lost in the gyms.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.25,0:38:45.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你把他们带来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought them here?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.38,0:38:46.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.28,0:38:53.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们朋友的事我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry about your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.54,0:38:55.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都感同身受\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know what that's like.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.51,0:38:57.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赫谢尔说你们需要援兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hershel said you could use some extra hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.91,0:38:59.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对付僵尸我们也不陌生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're no stranger to hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.83,0:39:03.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会自己出去找食物  不麻烦你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go out and get our own food, stay out of your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.33,0:39:04.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果有人跟你们过不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a problem with another group,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.95,0:39:05.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也会帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll help with that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.08,0:39:07.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不遗余力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything to contribute.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.74,0:39:14.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.13,0:39:16.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.56,0:39:19.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}《十个小印第安人》英国推理小说  故事中十人依次离奇死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.56,0:39:19.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面就像《十个小印第安人》\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like "10 Little Indians" Out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.08,0:39:21.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是主人公换成了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.06,0:39:26.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.33,0:39:28.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们好好谈谈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's talk about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.47,0:39:29.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能眼看着...\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't just keep...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.69,0:39:30.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们经历过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.94,0:39:35.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,托马斯和安德鲁的加入  结果怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}With Tomas, Andrew. Look what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.47,0:39:37.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿克塞尔和奥斯卡和他们不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Axel and Oscar weren't like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.54,0:39:38.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奥斯卡现在人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where's Oscar now?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.90,0:39:49.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我担不起这个责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.01,0:39:51.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把我们赶走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You turned us out,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.38,0:39:53.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,责任就得你承担\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.47,0:39:55.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.35,0:40:02.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为我们做了很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've done so much for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.69,0:40:05.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很感激  我们都很感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate that. We all do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.60,0:40:07.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的命都是你给的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We owe you our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.41,0:40:11.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么我们做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've done everything you asked without question.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.10,0:40:16.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你现在做的是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm telling you you're wrong on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.41,0:40:20.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得开始学会给他人生存机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to start giving people a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.77,0:40:49.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.55,0:41:05.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.49,0:41:09.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.94,0:41:10.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.92,0:41:16.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.00,0:41:22.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.55,0:41:26.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你想让我做什么  -爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you want from me? - Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.76,0:41:28.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么...  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you... no.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.51,0:41:37.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我帮不了你  走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't help you. Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.59,0:41:40.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get-- get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.13,0:41:43.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.17,0:41:44.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.15,0:41:46.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事儿的  瑞克  你不需要...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, easy, Rick. There's no need to...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.75,0:41:49.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经不属于这里了  求求你  走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't belong here! Get out! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.87,0:41:50.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冷静点  老兄  冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, brother. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.90,0:41:51.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走开  走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.42,0:41:53.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们走  我们这就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll leave. We're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.57,0:41:55.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行吗  没必要动枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? Ain't nobody got to get shot here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.51,0:41:57.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are going.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.69,0:42:01.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好了  我们走了  -快走  快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, we're going. - Just go! Go! Go!
